<item><title>Djiboutian media creator wins IGAD award for local-language migration work</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/dj/djiboutian-media-creator-wins-igad-award-for-local-language-20a10a/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/dj/djiboutian-media-creator-wins-igad-award-for-local-language-20a10a/</guid><category>Djibouti</category><description>Migane Mohamed Megag received the Kampala trophy for work on migration and human mobility produced in a local language.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 08:44:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/dj.jpg" length="31696" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/dj.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Djibouti delivers veterinary medicines to Jaban-Ass dairy cooperatives</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/dj/djibouti-delivers-veterinary-medicines-to-jaban-ass-dairy-56704a/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/dj/djibouti-delivers-veterinary-medicines-to-jaban-ass-dairy-56704a/</guid><category>Djibouti</category><description>The emergency aid is intended to treat livestock with health problems that have persisted for several weeks and threaten milk production.</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 18:48:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/dj/djibouti-delivers-veterinary-medicines-to-jaban-ass-dairy-56704a/share.jpg" length="44699" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/dj/djibouti-delivers-veterinary-medicines-to-jaban-ass-dairy-56704a/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Djibouti proposes permanent African audit strategy group</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/dj/djibouti-proposes-permanent-african-audit-strategy-group-0ea58d/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/dj/djibouti-proposes-permanent-african-audit-strategy-group-0ea58d/</guid><category>Djibouti</category><description>The proposal came at a workshop in Djibouti where 11 national audit institutions and the West African monetary union&apos;s court are taking part.</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 15:35:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/dj.jpg" length="31696" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/dj.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
